===Look for Yanqing in the crowd{{subst:void|<!--202200201-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=continuance|location=Central Starskiff Haven|Arriving at the Luofu, you are greeted by an overwhelming sight of starskiffs.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}
:{{tx}}
:'''March 7th:''' Coming back to this place brings back so many memories, you know...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} So, here's something for all of you, a poem by March 7th...
::'''March 7th:''' Hey, I'm not actually gonna recite a poem! I was just thinking about all the twists and turns we went through when we first arrived on the Xianzhou...
::What memories? Care to spill the details?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} What memories? Care to spill the details?
:'''March 7th:''' Well, it's nothing too poetic. I was just thinking about all the twists and turns we went through when we first arrived at the Xianzhou ship...
:'''March 7th:''' This time, we're not being forced or enticed, or chasing after wanted criminals. And we didn't have to sneak in through the cargo dock. This trip has been incredibly smooth...
:'''March 7th:''' Quite unusual, I must say!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Definitely unusual!
::'''Dan Heng:''' I agree.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} We're so easily pleased. I actually feel sorry for us...
::'''March 7th:''' Such is the fate of us Nameless, I suppose.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Oh, come on, don't jinx us...
::'''March 7th:''' Haha, I'm just hoping for the best! You're the one jinxing us!
:{{tx}}
