:'''Pepeshi Tourist:''' Hey, you guys! Hold on a moment!
:'''March 7th:''' Did they just call us? Look at their outfits... they're from Penacony, right?
:'''Pepeshi Tourist:''' Are you familiar with the Xianzhou Luofu?
:'''Dan Heng:''' We know a little bit about it. What do you need?
:'''Intellitron Tourist:''' We're from Penacony, maybe you've heard of it? We came to this ship to gather interesting materials for making dream bubbles.
:'''March 7th:''' We just left there. Talk about coincidence.
:'''Intellitron Tourist:''' That's great! Do you know any must-see attractions on the Luofu?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} You've come to the right people!
::'''March 7th:''' Exactly! We're Xianzhou experts!
::Why don't you ask the locals?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Why don't you ask the locals?
:'''Pepeshi Tourist:''' We did! But the locals were all like, "Come on, there's nothing worth seeing on the Luofu! It's so boring here!"
:'''Intellitron Tourist:''' Can't blame them. If someone asked me, "What's there to see on Penacony?" I'd probably struggle to answer too.
:'''Pepeshi Tourist:''' That's why we're asking fellow tourists!
:'''March 7th:''' Most of the tourists around at the moment are here to attend the Wardance, and that's why we're here too.
:'''Pepeshi Tourist:''' Yeah, we know about that ceremony, but isn't the fighting ring still closed?
:'''Intellitron Tourist:''' I've heard the ring was actually converted from a huge decommissioned Luofu fighter jet.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} So, it's even larger than a regular starskiff?
::'''Intellitron Tourist:''' No doubt about it! It's a massive fighter jet! It's got to be larger than a civilian starskiff!
::So, it's even bigger than the Radiant Feldspar?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} So, it's even bigger than the Radiant Feldspar?
:'''Intellitron Tourist:''' The Radiant Feldspar is bigger, I guess!
:'''Pepeshi Tourist:''' But for now, all we can do is wait until the Wardance starts in a few weeks before we can board it. We've still got work to do, so we can't just sit around waiting for it to start, that's why we're asking you about some must-see attractions.
:'''Intellitron Tourist:''' We're looking for unique experiences that you won't find on Penacony. Our clients love these kinds of dream bubbles the most.
:'''March 7th:''' You're the expert here, (Trailblazer). Give them some suggestions!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Why not visit Aurum Alley?
