===Meet Yanqing again{{subst:void|<!--202200203-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=continuance|location=Central Starskiff Haven|update|Although you and Yanqing have not been apart for long, but you seem to feel that this kid has somehow grown a little taller.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}
;(По прибытии на место)

;(По прибытии на место)
:'''Yanqing:''' Hey, everyone! It's been a while!
:'''March 7th:''' Doesn't feel like it's been that long since we last saw you, but Yanqing, are you...?
:'''Yanqing:''' What's up, Miss March?
:'''March 7th:''' They say kids grow up really fast. Yanqing, are you a little bit taller than before?
:'''Dan Heng:''' We've only been away for a few months.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Long time no see, Yanqing!
::'''March 7th:''' Long time no see!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Yeah, you're definitely taller!
::'''Yanqing:''' Really? The General is always worried I won't grow much taller, but I keep telling him not to worry about it.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} (Cautiously pinch Yanqing's cheek)
::'''Yanqing:''' Huh? What are you doing, (Trailblazer)?
