:'''March 7th:''' Seriously, I've never seen the Luofu so lively before.
:'''Dan Heng:''' I was a bit worried that holding the Wardance right after the Ambrosial Arbor crisis might be too soon, but seeing the bustling Starskiff Haven, I understand why General Jing Yuan chose this timing.
:'''Yanqing:''' Yep, there's people from other delves and travelers like you three who've come from afar.
:'''Yanqing:''' With the Wardance coming up, there's a huge number of visitors pouring into the Starskiff Haven. The Cloud Knights are working hard to keep the security tight.
:'''Yanqing:''' The General said this ceremony would help the Xianzhou Luofu recover from the crisis.
:'''Yanqing:''' It's a way to showcase our martial spirit, reassure people, boost morale, and attract visitors from other planets to promote trade and peace.
:'''Yanqing:''' By the way, the Xianzhou Alliance places great importance on this ceremony, too. The Xianzhou ships the Zhuming and the Yaoqing have both sent messengers to offer their blessings!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} The Xianzhou Zhuming?
::'''Yanqing:''' Yeah, I wonder if you've heard of it, (Trailblazer). It's known as the "Starforge" and is responsible for providing more than half of the Cloud Knights' armaments.
::'''Yanqing:''' The Xianzhou Zhuming boasts skilled craftsmasters, and General Huaiyan is a top-notch craftsman himself. Ah... if only I could get a sword forged by him! I'd be on cloud nine.
::The Xianzhou Yaoqing?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} The Xianzhou Yaoqing?
:'''Yanqing:''' Yeah, the Xianzhou Yaoqing is a major force in hunting down abominations and is always engaged in conflicts across the cosmos. Although it's a member of the Xianzhou Alliance, I don't know much about it.
:'''Yanqing:''' But Madam Yukong from the Sky-Faring Commission mentioned that the Yaoqing always sends back reports of great victories, which is quite impressive.
:'''Yanqing:''' I heard General Feixiao of the Yaoqing is a young and dauntless lady. My peers say that she's like a goddess of war, capable of crushing dozens of abominations with a single punch... I wonder if it's true.
:'''Yanqing:''' ...If only I could witness her prowess with my own eyes.
:'''March 7th:''' By the way, Yanqing, where are we headed next?
:'''Yanqing:''' Ah, I'm sorry for talking your ear off. The General wants to catch up with you at the Palace of Astrum. He's been eager to hear about how the Express has been doing.
:'''March 7th:''' Hehe, it's funny how he tries to act all mature, but whenever it comes to something he's interested in, you can really see his childish side.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Well, you're pretty much the same in that regard.
::'''Dan Heng:''' I agree.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Yeah, he's adorable.
::'''March 7th:''' I agree.
:{{tx}}
:'''???:''' (frantic roars)
